                    Capt. Luis M. A. Terradas; from the Ministry of Marine, Rear Adm. Sabá H.
                    Sueyro, Comdr. Aureliano G. Lares, Comdr. Harald Cappus, Comdr. Carlos A.
                    Garzoni, Lt. Comdr, Manuel Bianchi, and Lt. Comdr. Eburo Díaz Molina.</p>
            </note>
